<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sovran, Shurgard Storage raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sovran, Shurgard Storage raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it upgraded Shurgard Storage Centers Inc to near-term accumulate from neutral. The long-term rating remains accumulate.</p>
<p>-- said raised Sovran Self Storage Inc to near-term accumulate from neutral. The long-term rating remains accumulate.</p>
<p>-- said lowered Public Storage Inc to near-term neutral from accumulate. The long-term rating remains accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>	 (( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
